WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.939 --> 00:00:07.840
NASA estimates that the value of all the minerals
in the asteroid belt exceeds this $600,000,000,000,000,000,000.

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:18.550
Or to put it in other words, roughly $100
billion for each person alive.

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:24.570
The fingerprints of koala bears are virtually
indistinguishable from those of humans.

00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:31.420
In 1959 the United States Postal Service attempted
to deliver mail by cruise missile and successfully

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:36.070
shipped cargo from New Jersey to Florida in
22 minutes.

00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:40.960
The "Yin-Yang" symbol was first used in Ancient
Rome, not China.

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:44.859
Your heart rate rises as much as 30% during
a yawn.

00:00:44.859 --> 00:00:48.190
The first word spoken on the moon was Okay.

00:00:48.190 --> 00:00:52.710
An apple will wake you up better in the morning
than coffee.

00:00:52.710 --> 00:00:55.670
This is because of an apple's high sugar content.

00:00:55.670 --> 00:01:00.370
If you keep a goldfish in the dark, it will
eventually turn white.

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:04.970
In nearly every species of mammal the female
lives longer than the male.

00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:11.220
There is a service in Boulder, Colorado called
Hangover Helpers that will come to your place

00:01:11.220 --> 00:01:13.220
the morning after a party.

00:01:13.220 --> 00:01:20.010
Bring gatorade, cook everyone a breakfast
burrito and clean up for $20 per person.

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:25.150
Pope Francis, the leader of the Catholic Church
once worked as a bouncer in an Argentinean

00:01:25.150 --> 00:01:26.150
bar.

00:01:26.150 --> 00:01:32.730
John F Kennedy had his press secretary purchase
1,200 Cuban cigars and confirmed the purchase

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:38.680
was complete before signing the documents
that made the embargo against Cuba official.

00:01:38.680 --> 00:01:44.950
Beetles taste like apples, wasps like pine
nuts and worms like fried bacon.

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:51.670
In Australia "Jedi" is an official religion,
known as Jediism, it has over 70,000 followers.

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:59.640
The word "dude" was first used in the late
1800s as an insult towards men who were overly

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:02.350
concerned with keeping up with the latest
fashions.

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:07.890
In ten minutes, a hurricane releases more
energy than all the world's nuclear weapons

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:11.560
combined.

